{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110062","id":2782667560,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6l3CMo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110062","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110062.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110062.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110062","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110062/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110062/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110062/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f36732a510c78ed3760714133799105dbb3d392","number":110062,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `Array.sort_by_key` method","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Added a new `sort_by_key` method on `Array` that takes a `Callable` argument to generate a key for each item in the array, then sorts by these key values.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11477 (and maybe https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5552 - the interface used here is different than discussed in that proposal, but this does provide a stable sort)\r\n\r\nThe new `sort_by_key` method has a few benefits over using `sort_custom`:\r\n- `sort_custom`'s `Callable` argument must be called for each comparison done in the sort, resulting in O(nlogn) calls.  For `sort_by_key`, the `Callable` is only called once per item, then all sorting is done within C++ code.  Due to the overhead of calling into gdscript functions, this makes `sort_by_key` significantly faster than `sort_custom`, around 3-10x faster depending on size of array and `Callable` used.\r\n- `sort_by_key` is a stable sort.  Since the keys need to be linked back to the original `Variant` (currently done by storing the index with the key), `_ArrayVariantKeySort` has enough information to keep the original ordering of equal items.\r\n- Slightly simpler to call - this might just be my own preference, but for cases when the same property is being compared between two items in the array, half of `sort_custom`'s lambda argument is basically just duplicating the same field/method call for each item.  `sort_by_key` feels more direct/concise, only specifying the field to sort by once.\r\n\r\nI think the main downside/trade-off is that `sort_by_key` uses a separate array to store the keys while sorting, so it does require more memory than `sort_custom`.\r\n\r\nI have another PR open at https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96014 that focuses on just adding stable versions of existing sort methods.  I think this PR should probably replace that one - I don't think there's much value in more stable sorting methods if `sort_by_key` is added, but leaving both open for now.\r\n\r\nCompared with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_custom_small\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_by_key_small\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_custom_large\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_by_key_large\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_custom_obj\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_custom_obj_fast\")\r\n\trun_test(\"sort_by_key_obj\")\r\n\r\nfunc get_array(size: int):\r\n\tvar arr: Array\r\n\tfor i in size:\r\n\t\tarr.push_back(Vector3(i, i*2, i*3))\r\n\treturn arr\r\n\r\nfunc get_obj_array(size: int):\r\n\tvar arr: Array\r\n\tfor i in size:\r\n\t\tvar node2D = Node2D.new()\r\n\t\tnode2D.position.x = i % 10\r\n\t\tnode2D.position.y = i / 10\r\n\t\tarr.push_back(node2D)\r\n\treturn arr\r\n\r\nfunc run_test(test_name: String):\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tcall(test_name)\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%s: %dms\" % [test_name.rpad(21), end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc sort_custom_small():\r\n\tvar arr = get_array(20)\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_custom(func(a: Vector3, b: Vector3): return a.length() < b.length())\r\n\r\nfunc sort_by_key_small():\r\n\tvar arr = get_array(20)\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_by_key(func(v: Vector3): return v.length())\r\n\t\t\r\nfunc sort_custom_large():\r\n\tvar arr = get_array(100000)\r\n\tfor i in 10:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_custom(func(a: Vector3, b: Vector3): return a.length() < b.length())\r\n\r\nfunc sort_by_key_large():\r\n\tvar arr = get_array(100000)\r\n\tfor i in 10:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_by_key(func(v: Vector3): return v.length())\r\n\r\nfunc sort_custom_obj():\r\n\tvar arr = get_obj_array(1000)\r\n\tfor i in 1000:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_custom(func(a: Node2D, b: Node2D):\r\n\t\t\treturn [a.position.y, a.position.x] < [b.position.y, b.position.x]\r\n\t\t)\r\n\r\nfunc sort_custom_obj_fast():\r\n\tvar arr = get_obj_array(1000)\r\n\tfor i in 1000:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_custom(func(a: Node2D, b: Node2D):\r\n\t\t\tif a.position.y < b.position.y:\r\n\t\t\t\treturn true\r\n\t\t\tif a.position.y > b.position.y:\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false\r\n\t\t\treturn a.position.x < b.position.x\r\n\t\t)\r\n\r\nfunc sort_by_key_obj():\r\n\tvar arr = get_obj_array(1000)\r\n\tfor i in 1000:\r\n\t\tarr.shuffle()\r\n\t\tarr.sort_by_key(func(n: Node2D): return [n.position.y, n.position.x])\r\n```\r\n\r\nResults:\r\n```\r\nsort_custom_small    : 1202ms\r\nsort_by_key_small    : 426ms\r\nsort_custom_large    : 2209ms\r\nsort_by_key_large    : 445ms\r\nsort_custom_obj      : 11345ms\r\nsort_custom_obj_fast : 6116ms\r\nsort_by_key_obj      : 1205ms\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","htm